WEBVTT

00:13.630 --> 00:15.240
<b>What...</b>

00:15.240 --> 00:17.160
<b>is that thing?</b>

00:21.130 --> 00:22.830
<b>Impossible!</b>

00:23.390 --> 00:26.300
<b>That's a really powerful person, Mr. Jack.</b>

00:26.650 --> 00:27.920
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:27.920 --> 00:30.340
<b>But what we must do hasn't changed.</b>

00:30.340 --> 00:32.220
<b>Your command, Master.</b>

00:32.220 --> 00:34.260
<b>Okay, then...</b>

00:34.260 --> 00:36.100
<b>let's stop that person!</b>

02:08.870 --> 02:13.360
<b>Where is the child
with the Heroic Spirit within her body?</b>

02:13.840 --> 02:17.240
<b>If we tell you, what will you do to them?</b>

02:17.240 --> 02:20.620
<b>Of course, following the rules
of the Holy Grail War...</b>

02:21.050 --> 02:22.660
<b>I will face her...</b>

02:22.660 --> 02:24.580
<b>and slaughter her.</b>

02:24.930 --> 02:26.170
<b>Stop joking—</b>

02:33.020 --> 02:35.300
<b>If you cannot answer, that is fine.</b>

02:35.610 --> 02:37.260
<b>Don't get in my way.</b>

02:39.070 --> 02:41.600
<b>If any stand in our way, bite them dead!</b>

02:46.200 --> 02:47.980
<b>Dammit!</b>

02:47.980 --> 02:50.480
<b>Who is that? Hey, wait!</b>

03:09.270 --> 03:11.040
<b>Oh brother.</b>

03:11.040 --> 03:13.300
<b>What's wrong? What's wrong, police force?</b>

03:13.690 --> 03:17.340
<b>I'm in trouble if you 
don't put in more effort.</b>

03:17.730 --> 03:23.810
<b>It'd be a problem for me, as well,
if Tsubaki Kuruoka were to be murdered.</b>

03:26.160 --> 03:28.310
<b>Some sort of demonic creature?</b>

03:28.310 --> 03:29.480
<b>Ah well...</b>

03:33.080 --> 03:34.820
<b>What is your problem?</b>

03:34.820 --> 03:37.200
<b>Are you also what they 
call a "Dead Apostle"?</b>

03:38.130 --> 03:39.280
<b>What...</b>

03:39.760 --> 03:41.740
<b>is Cerberus doing?</b>

03:51.270 --> 03:53.000
<b>The same face?</b>

03:53.310 --> 03:54.340
<b>Who...</b>

03:54.810 --> 03:56.010
<b>are these guys?</b>

03:59.150 --> 04:01.590
<b>Ridiculous! This is...</b>

04:01.590 --> 04:03.680
<b>There is nothing ridiculous about this.</b>

04:03.990 --> 04:08.690
<b>I'm originally a slasher
who claimed to have come from Hell.</b>

04:08.690 --> 04:10.370
<b>Being repeatedly gnawed to death</b>

04:10.370 --> 04:13.190
<b>by the guardian dog of 
hell is only appropriate.</b>

04:13.360 --> 04:17.030
<b>To have the guardian dog
of the underworld as your subject...</b>

04:17.030 --> 04:21.820
<b>Can it be that Hades himself
has materialized?</b>

04:21.820 --> 04:23.700
<b>O weak one...</b>

04:23.700 --> 04:27.370
<b>Never again compare me with the fools...</b>

04:27.370 --> 04:28.830
<b>known as "the gods"!</b>

04:29.640 --> 04:32.830
<b>Would you like to pay a price
worse than death?</b>

04:34.550 --> 04:36.170
<b>Pardon.</b>

04:36.170 --> 04:38.630
<b>I apologize for trying to probe.</b>

04:38.630 --> 04:40.010
<b>I see.</b>

04:40.010 --> 04:43.090
<b>Indeed, you do not seem to be a god.</b>

04:43.720 --> 04:46.510
<b>If you had any ties with gods,</b>

04:46.510 --> 04:48.700
<b>I could have forcibly 
connected you to karma</b>

04:48.700 --> 04:50.690
<b>and perhaps mimic that guise of yours.</b>

04:50.920 --> 04:54.400
<b>But it seems that I cannot become you.</b>

04:54.960 --> 04:58.360
<b>However, I understand your true nature.</b>

04:58.360 --> 05:00.360
<b>Great hero who denies the gods.</b>

05:00.920 --> 05:02.340
<b>I'd venture to say that once,</b>

05:02.340 --> 05:06.120
<b>their blood flowed through 
your veins, as well.</b>

05:07.510 --> 05:11.420
<b>Then, I shall treat you as a human.</b>

05:11.620 --> 05:12.960
<b>And...</b>

05:12.960 --> 05:14.420
<b>I shall kill you off...</b>

05:16.170 --> 05:18.380
<b>as a human.</b>

05:20.440 --> 05:22.590
<b>How about you come inside?</b>

05:23.070 --> 05:25.550
<b>If you stay out in the open
like that, they'll target you.</b>

05:25.730 --> 05:28.400
<b>It's fine! I'd like to see Mr. Ja—</b>

05:28.400 --> 05:30.410
<b>Mr. Berserker's hour of triumph...</b>

05:30.410 --> 05:33.140
<b>without using Strengthening on my vision.</b>

05:33.140 --> 05:33.900
<b>Oh?</b>

05:34.370 --> 05:36.090
<b>That person wearing fur</b>

05:36.090 --> 05:40.070
<b>seems to not only be a Heroic Spirit
but is as strong as a Divine Spirit.</b>

05:41.290 --> 05:45.740
<b>But Mr. Berserker won't 
lose to anyone here!</b>

05:59.560 --> 06:01.960
<b><i>What am I doing? Get it together!</i></b>

06:03.480 --> 06:05.340
<b>No need for intervention.</b>

06:06.320 --> 06:08.600
<b>That is my prey.</b>

06:08.800 --> 06:12.560
<b>Your job is to take custody of
and protect Tsubaki Kuruoka.</b>

06:13.120 --> 06:16.520
<b>Please don't waste the conviction
of my Master in vain.</b>

06:18.580 --> 06:20.480
<b>Weak one...</b>

06:20.480 --> 06:21.690
<b>Tell me your name.</b>

06:22.920 --> 06:25.660
<b>No name exists for me.</b>

06:25.660 --> 06:27.450
<b>O great hero,</b>

06:27.450 --> 06:31.620
<b>a living legend from mythology
that continues to exist with the times...</b>

06:31.620 --> 06:33.670
<b>A being who keeps living...</b>

06:33.970 --> 06:37.670
<b>You must have some reason
to harbor such determination.</b>

06:37.980 --> 06:39.340
<b>However...</b>

06:39.340 --> 06:42.630
<b>if you are saying you are going to deny
the authority of the divine...</b>

06:43.150 --> 06:48.970
<b>and you'll deny all doings of the gods,
evil or good, and toss them all away...</b>

06:48.970 --> 06:53.770
<b>then your current self is a human
just as you wished.</b>

06:53.770 --> 06:58.190
<b>You are a hero who has stooped
to a scoundrel and risen to a human!</b>

06:58.500 --> 07:01.770
<b>No matter what kind of 
great hero you are...</b>

07:01.770 --> 07:04.900
<b>no matter if you have
the power to destroy the world...</b>

07:05.900 --> 07:08.570
<b>so long as your true nature is human...</b>

07:08.570 --> 07:13.790
<b>you will be hunted
by an ordinary slasher with no power.</b>

07:15.640 --> 07:17.710
<b><i>From Hell.</i></b>

07:25.860 --> 07:27.300
<b>Can it be...</b>

07:27.300 --> 07:28.130
<b>Jack...</b>

07:28.480 --> 07:30.010
<b>Jack...</b>

07:30.010 --> 07:31.600
<b>It's Jack the Ripper!</b>

07:31.830 --> 07:34.320
<b>The folklore of a powerless Anti-Hero</b>

07:34.320 --> 07:37.560
<b>painting the night's shadows
with fresh blood!</b>

07:37.870 --> 07:40.520
<b>Not even the Night of Wallachia
could catch up with his speed...</b>

07:40.520 --> 07:45.320
<b>An incarnation of corruption
propagating terror to the entire world!</b>

07:48.170 --> 07:50.570
<b>You just can't get enough of this world!</b>

07:51.170 --> 07:53.160
<b>My beautiful Assassin!</b>

07:53.160 --> 07:56.620
<b>I offer this comical hell to you!</b>

08:20.160 --> 08:21.520
<b>A demon...</b>

08:24.580 --> 08:26.360
<b>I see.</b>

08:26.360 --> 08:31.320
<b>This is what humans imagine
when faced with a tragedy or ill will.</b>

08:31.530 --> 08:35.240
<b>The manifestation of Hell
that a warped desire brings forth.</b>

08:35.240 --> 08:40.080
<b>There are just as many desires and fears
as there are humans.</b>

08:40.080 --> 08:45.460
<b>The center of this metropolis
is the tastiest of hells for him.</b>

08:45.980 --> 08:48.050
<b>Had I not known he was a Heroic Spirit,</b>

08:48.050 --> 08:51.180
<b>I would have asked the Burial Agency
to head over here.</b>

08:51.180 --> 08:52.430
<b>Well...</b>

08:52.430 --> 08:55.680
<b>I didn't expect this.</b>

08:56.660 --> 08:59.140
<b>Without the blessing of Hades...</b>

08:59.450 --> 09:01.850
<b>you're still beneath a Divine Beast.</b>

09:02.870 --> 09:03.650
<b>Hmm?</b>

09:13.590 --> 09:16.280
<b>So, you are here, powerful king.</b>

09:16.680 --> 09:18.290
<b>The King of Heroes...</b>

09:18.290 --> 09:20.040
<b>Gilgamesh!</b>

09:28.400 --> 09:31.670
<b>They appear to be toying with you
quite a bit, mongrel.</b>

09:32.070 --> 09:35.970
<b>I thought I saw quite
an outlandish sight and came by.</b>

09:36.280 --> 09:39.270
<b>But to think your opponent
was mere human delusions...</b>

09:39.270 --> 09:41.440
<b>A quality piece of irony for you.</b>

09:56.050 --> 09:59.130
<b>You amuse me quite well.</b>

09:59.130 --> 10:02.960
<b>You may have the talent to become a clown.</b>

10:10.770 --> 10:12.130
<b>What's with this?</b>

10:12.690 --> 10:14.590
<b>This is ridiculous!</b>

10:21.950 --> 10:22.770
<b>Oh no!</b>

10:29.520 --> 10:31.530
<b>Wh-What the...</b>

10:31.530 --> 10:32.820
<b>Hey!</b>

10:32.820 --> 10:34.990
<b>What exactly is going on here?</b>

10:35.590 --> 10:37.200
<b>Isn't this a bit different...</b>

10:37.200 --> 10:38.820
<b>from what was planned?</b>

10:41.220 --> 10:44.410
<b>Wasn't this supposed to 
be a covert operation?</b>

10:44.410 --> 10:46.750
<b>The situation changed
while we were in transit.</b>

10:46.750 --> 10:47.630
<b>That's all.</b>

10:47.980 --> 10:50.510
<b>I see. Then there's nothing
we can do about that.</b>

10:50.510 --> 10:52.800
<b>H-Hold on. Is that okay?</b>

10:53.310 --> 10:55.420
<b>The Saber that broke out of jail?</b>

10:55.420 --> 10:56.400
<b>That's...</b>

10:56.400 --> 10:57.680
<b>Assassin!</b>

10:58.740 --> 11:00.220
<b>Why?</b>

11:00.220 --> 11:05.390
<b>Why is the beautiful Assassin's body
not corrupted with my Magical Energy?</b>

11:05.390 --> 11:07.810
<b>Goodness, I'm at a loss here!</b>

11:07.810 --> 11:10.860
<b>Servants can summon man-eating fiends now?</b>

11:11.030 --> 11:13.080
<b>"Man-eating fiend," you say.</b>

11:13.080 --> 11:16.820
<b>Indeed, those are suitable words
for my current state.</b>

11:17.710 --> 11:20.890
<b>No, I'll take that back.</b>

11:20.890 --> 11:22.790
<b>You seem to be a good guy.</b>

11:23.020 --> 11:24.120
<b>Oh?</b>

11:24.720 --> 11:28.830
<b>You're the second person
to say that I am a good guy.</b>

11:28.830 --> 11:30.170
<b>I see!</b>

11:30.170 --> 11:32.960
<b>That person has a sure eye for things!</b>

11:32.960 --> 11:34.130
<b>But...</b>

11:34.130 --> 11:37.090
<b>it looks like this isn't a situation
where we can waste time much.</b>

11:37.400 --> 11:40.090
<b>I'm sorry, can I trust you with Ayaka?</b>

11:40.450 --> 11:43.390
<b>I would like you to deliver her
to that church over there.</b>

11:43.390 --> 11:44.810
<b>What are you going to do?</b>

11:45.280 --> 11:48.270
<b>I'm concerned about that Heroic Spirit
covered in gold...</b>

11:48.830 --> 11:52.240
<b>but that murky one
was targeting the little girl, right?</b>

11:52.240 --> 11:54.820
<b>Then, I have to stop him first.</b>

11:54.820 --> 11:59.320
<b>No, I'd like you to take on
the golden Heroic Spirit.</b>

11:59.320 --> 12:01.990
<b>I will do something about that bowman.</b>

12:01.990 --> 12:03.530
<b>I see.</b>

12:03.530 --> 12:04.830
<b>I understand.</b>

12:04.830 --> 12:06.660
<b>I'll put my faith in you.</b>

12:09.430 --> 12:12.000
<b>Know your place, mongrel.</b>

12:12.480 --> 12:15.630
<b>Who gave you permission
to gaze up upon my glory?</b>

12:15.630 --> 12:18.220
<b>I got permission from my heart!</b>

12:18.220 --> 12:21.340
<b>I see that you are a famous hero
that is worthy of looking up at!</b>

12:21.690 --> 12:24.310
<b>From how you speak, you must be a king.</b>

12:24.820 --> 12:27.680
<b>I am grateful for being able
to stand here today!</b>

12:27.680 --> 12:32.060
<b>Mongrel, you think you appraised me
with those substandard eyes?</b>

12:32.410 --> 12:35.230
<b>I don't need gratitude. Disappear at once.</b>

12:36.330 --> 12:38.690
<b>Disappear? You mean from this world?</b>

12:39.650 --> 12:41.410
<b>You're a funny guy!</b>

12:45.470 --> 12:47.540
<b>You who I know not the name of...</b>

12:47.540 --> 12:49.590
<b>Though you are a man
in the shape of a demon...</b>

12:49.590 --> 12:51.840
<b>the weak are simply hunted.</b>

12:51.840 --> 12:53.830
<b>That arrogance...</b>

12:53.830 --> 12:56.090
<b>You indeed are human.</b>

12:59.900 --> 13:01.420
<b>Thank you.</b>

13:01.420 --> 13:03.640
<b>You should give thanks to your Servant.</b>

13:03.640 --> 13:05.470
<b>Jeez...</b>

13:05.470 --> 13:08.390
<b>We're technically only 
supposed to protect Masters</b>

13:08.390 --> 13:10.810
<b>who have abandoned the Holy Grail War.</b>

13:10.810 --> 13:12.690
<b>Sigma, what are you going to do?</b>

13:12.690 --> 13:15.820
<b>I'm going to take this chance
to find Tsubaki Kuruoka and protect her.</b>

13:16.750 --> 13:18.280
<b>Then, young lady...</b>

13:18.280 --> 13:20.030
<b>please come this way.</b>

13:20.030 --> 13:21.780
<b>Oh, okay.</b>

13:25.720 --> 13:27.410
<b>I shall go with you.</b>

13:27.410 --> 13:28.520
<b>Are you sure?</b>

13:28.520 --> 13:32.500
<b>I thought your objective
was the destruction of the Holy Grail War.</b>

13:32.500 --> 13:38.090
<b>With my inexperience, I'd need to put
everything on the line to destroy them.</b>

13:38.090 --> 13:39.630
<b>However, right now...</b>

13:39.630 --> 13:42.630
<b>the objective is rescuing a child, right?</b>

13:42.630 --> 13:44.720
<b>Why do you...</b>

13:45.360 --> 13:48.430
<b>Why do you go so far to save a child?</b>

13:48.740 --> 13:53.640
<b>Rationally speaking, this operation
should have no merit for you.</b>

13:54.700 --> 13:57.400
<b>That's right, you are not one of faith.</b>

13:58.040 --> 14:01.440
<b>There is no greater good
than saving a young child...</b>

14:01.440 --> 14:03.400
<b>whose heart has not been filled yet.</b>

14:03.400 --> 14:06.370
<b>I don't get it. Though a child,
we're talking about a stranger, right?</b>

14:06.370 --> 14:09.040
<b>I may still be inexperienced,</b>

14:09.040 --> 14:13.330
<b>but the devout do not think
about things like merit.</b>

14:14.020 --> 14:16.540
<b>They simply hear the greater voice...</b>

14:16.540 --> 14:18.630
<b>and choose that path.</b>

14:21.770 --> 14:25.220
<b>You are trying to save a 
child in this situation...</b>

14:25.220 --> 14:27.680
<b>because you are devout, right?</b>

14:27.680 --> 14:31.640
<b>I could not do away with anger
against the heretics...</b>

14:31.640 --> 14:34.230
<b>and could not become open-minded.</b>

14:34.540 --> 14:38.440
<b>So long as my wish to save others
is mixed with my faith...</b>

14:38.440 --> 14:41.190
<b>my faith is nothing but arrogance
that thinks lightly of destiny.</b>

14:41.750 --> 14:43.960
<b>But none of that matters.</b>

14:43.960 --> 14:48.780
<b>My inexperience is no reason
to not save the young child.</b>

14:49.260 --> 14:50.580
<b>I see.</b>

14:51.300 --> 14:53.540
<b>So, that's how things go.</b>

14:54.720 --> 14:56.290
<b>No one...</b>

14:56.290 --> 14:58.080
<b>came to save us.</b>

15:00.810 --> 15:02.110
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

15:02.110 --> 15:03.510
<b>That was a slip of the tongue.</b>

15:03.510 --> 15:07.840
<b>I could not save your young self
due to my inexperience.</b>

15:08.320 --> 15:11.810
<b>I could not come across that situation
and could not save you.</b>

15:12.200 --> 15:15.520
<b>That is precisely proof
that I am still inexperienced.</b>

15:16.620 --> 15:18.690
<b>You are a Servant.</b>

15:18.690 --> 15:21.440
<b>You existed in a different place and time.</b>

15:21.440 --> 15:23.990
<b>There's no way we could have met
when I was a child.</b>

15:23.990 --> 15:27.610
<b>The difference in time and location
is all but trivial.</b>

15:27.610 --> 15:28.950
<b>As proof of that...</b>

15:29.420 --> 15:34.080
<b>you and I are standing here
right now in the same space.</b>

15:35.220 --> 15:37.160
<b>Oh, I get it.</b>

15:37.560 --> 15:38.620
<b>I...</b>

15:39.230 --> 15:41.710
<b>wanted someone to save me.</b>

15:54.070 --> 15:55.470
<b>I see, I see!</b>

15:55.990 --> 15:57.760
<b>With such a masterpiece,</b>

15:57.760 --> 16:01.060
<b>you cause a calamity simply by
thrusting it into the ground!</b>

16:01.370 --> 16:04.400
<b>What about this wonderful ornamentation?</b>

16:04.400 --> 16:06.150
<b>Hey you!</b>

16:06.150 --> 16:07.780
<b>This is amazing!</b>

16:07.780 --> 16:10.110
<b>Are all the surrounding weapons
of the same tier?</b>

16:10.470 --> 16:13.780
<b>If you have so many of them,
can you give me a few?</b>

16:14.340 --> 16:16.790
<b>I thought you were a fly buzzing around,</b>

16:16.790 --> 16:19.170
<b>but you turned out to 
be a shameless beggar.</b>

16:19.520 --> 16:22.420
<b>Asking to receive it for free
was rather audacious of me!</b>

16:22.420 --> 16:26.130
<b>If I could pay something equal in value,
I'd love to purchase them from you!</b>

16:26.810 --> 16:33.100
<b>I wish to borrow these weapons as I please
while I fight you lot, so how about it?</b>

16:33.490 --> 16:37.670
<b>How dare you mouth off
such nonsense, mongrel!</b>

16:37.670 --> 16:40.390
<b>Yeah, I'm risking my 
life for this nonsense!</b>

16:59.260 --> 17:03.460
<b>Mongrel, I will allow you
to answer my question.</b>

17:03.460 --> 17:04.670
<b>What an honor!</b>

17:05.140 --> 17:08.260
<b>Looking at how you dodged 
that, I can tell.</b>

17:08.690 --> 17:12.090
<b>You've experienced something similar
in the past, haven't you?</b>

17:12.090 --> 17:13.300
<b>Yeah!</b>

17:13.300 --> 17:15.470
<b>I was in a similar situation yesterday.</b>

17:15.470 --> 17:18.440
<b>Though sky and earth were reversed.</b>

17:18.440 --> 17:20.560
<b>What happened to that opponent?</b>

17:20.560 --> 17:21.690
<b>We became friends.</b>

17:22.160 --> 17:23.980
<b>Masters... no...</b>

17:23.980 --> 17:26.150
<b>I mean, the contractors got along, too.</b>

17:26.150 --> 17:27.900
<b>I see.</b>

17:27.900 --> 17:32.860
<b>Despite being my friend, they are still
a softie when dealing with others.</b>

17:33.460 --> 17:34.720
<b>Huh?</b>

17:34.720 --> 17:36.080
<b>It looks like...</b>

17:36.080 --> 17:37.870
<b>I'm going to die here.</b>

17:37.870 --> 17:38.790
<b>Mongrel...</b>

17:38.960 --> 17:44.250
<b>I acknowledge you as a seeker of truth
suitable for me to provide a trial.</b>

17:44.560 --> 17:46.550
<b>If you survive it,</b>

17:46.550 --> 17:50.210
<b>I acknowledge you as their ally
and thus a clear enemy of mine.</b>

17:50.730 --> 17:57.050
<b>Then, I'll grant you the honor to be
the muck dripping off of my prized blades.</b>

17:57.050 --> 17:59.060
<b>You should be proud of that.</b>

18:00.060 --> 18:02.370
<b>This is a Holy Grail War after all.</b>

18:02.370 --> 18:06.170
<b>Once we meet, it naturally turns
into combat, I guess.</b>

18:06.170 --> 18:08.770
<b>Don't deceive yourself, mongrel.</b>

18:09.080 --> 18:12.180
<b>The one enjoying this 
situation most of all</b>

18:12.180 --> 18:14.240
<b>is none other than yourself, isn't it?</b>

18:15.090 --> 18:17.420
<b>I see. Yep.</b>

18:17.420 --> 18:21.200
<b>You seem to be a king who knows
about the world even more than I imagined.</b>

18:21.600 --> 18:23.370
<b>A pledge has been fulfilled!</b>

18:23.370 --> 18:25.920
<b>I shall take our words just now
as declarations of war...</b>

18:26.810 --> 18:29.880
<b>and I will commence my invasion!</b>

18:38.890 --> 18:42.960
<b>You said that because I 
am human, I will die...</b>

18:42.960 --> 18:44.100
<b>weak one?</b>

18:50.330 --> 18:53.990
<b>However, the Demonic 
Beast you have become...</b>

18:54.460 --> 18:57.820
<b>is what human hands
should be defeating, right?</b>

19:02.180 --> 19:03.870
<b>Incorrect.</b>

19:03.870 --> 19:05.540
<b>That is not so...</b>

19:05.540 --> 19:09.290
<b>one who has risen to become human
from a slave to the gods.</b>

19:11.520 --> 19:14.260
<b>Humans do not defeat us.</b>

19:14.260 --> 19:18.090
<b>Humans are the sages
who create us. They are fools.</b>

19:18.090 --> 19:20.720
<b>And they are merely feed
that cannibalize each other.</b>

19:24.370 --> 19:26.140
<b>Damn you!</b>

19:26.490 --> 19:28.900
<b><i>Natural Born Killers.</i></b>

20:05.530 --> 20:07.940
<b>Did he do it?</b>

20:11.250 --> 20:12.400
<b>Marvelous.</b>

20:12.750 --> 20:14.320
<b>That was marvelous...</b>

20:14.320 --> 20:15.480
<b>weak one.</b>

20:16.250 --> 20:18.950
<b>I commend you for running this body down.</b>

20:18.950 --> 20:20.700
<b>I commend you for rising to the pinnacle.</b>

20:21.340 --> 20:26.450
<b>Your power is not something worthless
to simply be shot down.</b>

20:27.390 --> 20:30.080
<b>What the hell are you—</b>

20:30.080 --> 20:32.250
<b>O slasher who I know not the name of...</b>

20:32.250 --> 20:33.630
<b>With respect...</b>

20:33.980 --> 20:36.760
<b>I will despoil from you.</b>

20:41.740 --> 20:43.180
<b>You are worthy...</b>

20:43.650 --> 20:45.390
<b>of pillaging!</b>

20:46.780 --> 20:49.770
<b><i>Reincarnation Pandora.</i></b>

20:58.750 --> 21:00.910
<b>You...</b>

21:00.910 --> 21:02.450
<b>Can it be?</b>

21:07.510 --> 21:08.790
<b>Mr. Jack!</b>

21:12.100 --> 21:14.040
<b>You took...</b>

21:14.040 --> 21:16.130
<b>my Noble Phantasm?</b>

21:16.980 --> 21:19.550
<b>Feel free to hold a grudge if you'd like.</b>

21:19.550 --> 21:22.550
<b>I am used to being 
vilified as the usurper.</b>

21:22.730 --> 21:24.010
<b>Retreat!</b>

21:24.010 --> 21:25.140
<b>We're canceling the operation!</b>

21:25.450 --> 21:26.970
<b><i>Can you hear me?</i></b>

21:31.490 --> 21:33.690
<b><i>Absurdities created by heresy...</i></b>

21:33.690 --> 21:36.360
<b><i>can only be kept in line 
with similar heresy.</i></b>

21:37.080 --> 21:38.320
<b><i>You guys are...</i></b>

21:38.320 --> 21:39.820
<b><i>justice!</i></b>

21:41.880 --> 21:43.740
<b>We are justice!</b>

21:44.840 --> 21:46.700
<b>John!</b>

21:46.700 --> 21:49.410
<b>You are brave, son of man.</b>

21:49.410 --> 21:51.710
<b>That is no mere recklessness.</b>

21:51.710 --> 21:54.920
<b>But for that, you are also so pitiful.</b>

22:07.510 --> 22:09.270
<b>John!</b>

22:07.510 --> 22:10.020
<b>EPISODE 9</b>
